note server/nostat.om: the seam of nodes/stat.om (<base>status and <base>status.json, the health of this
note forge's own Radicle node) for the store-reading build, which has no such node: its snapshot file
note (~/.local/state/aien-factory/nodes.txt) is left over from the node removed on 2026-11-14 and
note describes Radicle copies of the old ids, not anything this build serves. Both addresses answer 501
note (forge/error/1 for status.json), and agents.json lists status.json under not_available (run.sh
note agentsgen: the "nodes" part is composed only with server/radsrc.om).
text tfst "/status"
text tfstj "/status.json"
fn nsstat to long
if fpeq tfstj
fqajsn
end
ret 501
end
